{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AgentAvow/AgentAvow/issues/240","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AgentAvow/AgentAvow","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AgentAvow/AgentAvow/issues/240/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AgentAvow/AgentAvow/issues/240/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AgentAvow/AgentAvow/issues/240/events","html_url":"https://github.com/AgentAvow/AgentAvow/issues/240","id":6136484902,"node_id":"I_kwDORR9opc8AAAABbcNUJg","number":240,"title":"tool-manifest-digest v1: an independent read of mcp.deepwiki.com reproduces the three signed digests","user":{"login":"alexar76","id":86793359,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NzkzMzU5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86793359?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexar76","html_url":"https://github.com/alexar76","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexar76/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexar76/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexar76/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexar76/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexar76/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexar76/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexar76/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexar76/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexar76/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-10-31T15:21:09Z","updated_at":"2026-11-08T00:00:33Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"The runs recorded for the v1 set check implementations against the pinned fixture. Here is a different kind of independent record: another party reading the server itself.\n\nHISTOR (a public log of MCP tool definitions) read `https://mcp.deepwiki.com/mcp` on 26 Oct 2026 on its own schedule. The observation is in its signed snapshot of that day (tree head 1,074,932, `histor.modelmarket.dev/datasets/2026-10-26/`). Recomputing `agentavow.mcp-tool-definition.v1` from that stored definition, with `rfc8785==0.1.4`, the three digests equal the ones signed in the attestation on 1 Oct:\n\n- `tool:ask_wiki_question` `sha256:171a53c9725874258b0b1125bc1d1c517e1b02f91a236096a37f53cc3a763dc9`\n- `tool:read_wiki_contents` `sha256:3582a810…`\n- `tool:read_wiki_structure` `sha256:9bd57ff3…`\n\nOur implementation was written from the derivation in the README. On the pinned file at `474f34a` it gives 3/3 served-definition digests, 13/13 key encodings, and the one-sentence control flips. The definitions match field for field, so the server had not changed between 1 and 26 Oct.\n\nThe same comparison against heldfast's feed, with what makes two readers disagree (pagination, protocol version, launch environment), is in https://histor.modelmarket.dev/datasets/interop-digests-2026-10-31/.\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AgentAvow/AgentAvow/issues/240/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AgentAvow/AgentAvow/issues/240/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}